1. BASIS AND METHOD

This audit independently checks the committed G2-E implementation and control
plane. It does not infer closure from a copied PASS label. The evidence basis is
the committed Git graph, exact source identities, the safely validated V10
owner-review archive, its JUnit documents and receipts, the accepted G2-E
contracts, and the statically derived current Living and Conformance geometry.

The required first-parent implementation chain is exact:

  f582701208b603463a03d404aa841c302a8221d6
    Implement G2-E5 continuous delta runtime acceptance
  -> 7f3c7138b553096252fefee7930f89100d835fcd
