At audit start, main, HEAD, and local origin/main all resolved to the final
commit above, the index and worktree were clean, and no Git operation was
active. The Class-B commit changes exactly five implementation/integration
paths. The final repair commit changes exactly the two control-plane test
paths. No runtime path changes after the accepted Class-B commit.

